      },
      "message": "Add audience analytics scripts for heatmap generation\n\nPython scripts to generate interactive maps from Mailchimp audience exports:\n- generate_residence_heatmap.py: Maps where subscribers currently live\n- generate_jet_placement_heatmap.py: Maps JET Program placements in Japan\n\nBoth produce standalone HTML files with Leaflet maps and Chart.js visualizations.\nNo external Python dependencies required.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
